---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
const pages={index:{title:'Documentation — NightGuildBot',heading:'Explore the documentation.',intro:'Everything you need to get familiar with NightGuildBot, from your first command to the systems your community can grow together.',blocks:[['callout','Documentation status: These guides describe the project feature areas. Confirm exact commands, permissions and availability against the currently deployed bot before relying on them as definitive instructions.'],['grid',[['Getting started','A quick introduction to using NightGuildBot.','getting-started.html'],['Guild system','Create a guild and build shared progression.','guilds.html'],['Economy & progression','Currency, rewards and upgrades.','economy.html'],['Fishing','Catch fish and grow your collection.','fishing.html'],['Music','Playback, queues and voice features.','music.html'],['Text games','Hunting, collecting and battles.','owo.html'],['Commands','Browse command syntax and usage notes.','commands.html'],['Troubleshooting','First checks for common problems.','troubleshooting.html']]],['h2','Keep it current'],['p',"When a command or feature changes, update its guide alongside the bot release. Discord's slash-command picker and the bot's live responses remain the best source for currently available options."]]},'getting-started':{title:'Getting started — NightGuildBot',heading:'Getting started.',intro:'A simple route from finding NightGuildBot in your server to exploring its features.',blocks:[['h2','01 — Make sure the bot is available'],['p','NightGuildBot must be online in your Discord server. Your server staff may need to configure permissions and enable specific features.'],['h2','02 — Find the commands'],['p',"Open Discord's slash-command picker and search for NightGuildBot commands available to your account. Some commands may be restricted by permissions or server configuration."],['h2','03 — Pick your path'],['list',[['Guilds','guilds.html'],['Economy & progression','economy.html'],['Fishing','fishing.html'],['Music','music.html'],['Text games','owo.html']]],['callout','Command availability, cooldowns and permissions can vary by server configuration. Use the live bot responses as the source of truth.'],['h2','04 — Need a hand?'],['p','Visit the troubleshooting guide for basic checks, or ask your server staff for help.']]},guilds:{title:'Guilds — NightGuildBot',heading:'Find your people.',intro:'Guilds bring members together around shared identity, activity and progression.',blocks:[['h2','Create a guild'],['p','Use the guild creation option exposed by the bot in your server. Your current version may apply name rules, creation requirements, ownership limits or cooldowns.'],['h2','Grow together'],['p',"Invite other members and explore the guild's available management and progression features. Exact actions depend on the deployed version and role permissions."],['h2','Guild forum posts'],['p','Some deployments use a dedicated forum post to display guild information and management controls. If a post is missing, ask an authorized bot administrator to check the guild recovery tools rather than creating a duplicate guild.'],['warning','Confirm exact command names, role rules and management actions in the live bot before publishing detailed instructions.']]},economy:{title:'Economy & progression — NightGuildBot',heading:'Progress with purpose.',intro:'A shared economy and RPG-style progression give members reasons to keep playing and building together.',blocks:[['h2','Currency'],['p','Use the balance and economy options available in your server to understand your current funds, rewards and ways to spend. NightGuildBot V2 is designed around a single shared currency system.'],['h2','Personal and guild progression'],['p','Personal rewards and guild progression are designed to work alongside one another. Check each upgrade or purchase description before spending, especially where it affects shared guild resources.'],['h2','Upgrades and rewards'],['p','Available upgrades, costs and reward values can change between versions. Use live command descriptions as the source of truth.'],['warning','This is an overview, not a complete economy specification. Confirm exact commands, balance rules and costs against the current bot release.']]},fishing:{title:'Fishing — NightGuildBot',heading:'Cast a line. Complete the collection.',intro:'Fishing is about discovering species, collecting catches and building your own record over time.',blocks:[['h2','Getting started'],['p',"Use the fishing commands available in Discord to learn how to cast, view your catches and manage equipment. Check the command's help text for requirements and cooldowns."],['h2','Your Fishdex'],['p','The Fishdex is designed to make collection progress easier to follow, with catch counts and rarity distinctions. Explore entries to see what you have discovered.'],['h2','Equipment'],['p','Rods and available upgrades may affect your fishing experience. Check item descriptions before purchasing or equipping an upgrade.'],['warning','Fishing rules, rarity rates, rod effects and command syntax should be verified against the current bot implementation before being documented as exact values.']]},music:{title:'Music — NightGuildBot',heading:'Set the soundtrack.',intro:'Bring music into a voice channel and let your community listen together.',blocks:[['h2','Playback basics'],['p','Join a voice channel, then use the play command with a supported link or search query. Available controls may include pause, resume, skip, stop and queue management.'],['h2','Sources and availability'],['p','Supported providers depend on the resolver and audio setup used by the running bot. A provider link may identify a track and locate a playable match rather than stream directly from that service.'],['h2','If playback fails'],['p','Check that the bot can connect and speak in the voice channel. If the issue persists, server staff can review audio dependencies and runtime logs.'],['warning','Supported sources, command names and available controls depend on the current deployment. Verify them before publishing a complete command list.']]},owo:{title:'Text games — NightGuildBot',heading:'A little more play.',intro:'NightGuildBot includes an OwO-inspired collection of chat-based game mechanics.',blocks:[['h2','Hunting and collecting'],['p','']]},commands:{title:'Commands — NightGuildBot',heading:'Command reference.',intro:'A home for command syntax, options, permissions and examples. Update this reference alongside each bot release.',blocks:[['warning','Command list not yet verified: exact names and options must be checked against the current NightGuildBot V2 slash-command files.'],['h2','How to read a command'],['p','Use Discord descriptions for required and optional options. Square brackets indicate optional values; angle brackets indicate required placeholders.'],['code','/command-name [optional] <required>'],['h2','Feature categories'],['list',[['Guild management','guilds.html'],['Economy and progression','economy.html'],['Fishing and Fishdex','fishing.html'],['Music and queue controls','music.html'],['Text games and combat','owo.html']]],['h2','Command documentation checklist'],['p','Document each command name, purpose, options, permissions, cooldown and a tested example.']]},troubleshooting:{title:'Troubleshooting — NightGuildBot',heading:"Let's get it working.",intro:'A few first checks can help narrow down common issues.',blocks:[['h2','A command does not appear'],['p','Check that the command is registered and deployed, and that your account has permission to use it. Adding a command file does not necessarily publish it to Discord.'],['h2','A command fails'],['p','']]}};
pages.owo.blocks=[['h2','Hunting and collecting'],['p','Discover animals through the available hunt features, then explore your inventory and collection records where supported.'],['h2','Combat and progression'],['p','Some versions include battle and RPG-style systems. Check live command help for team setup, combat rules, item usage and progression requirements.'],['h2',"What's included?"],['p','NightGuildBot is its own project, not a full copy of another bot. Individual commands and mechanics may differ from similar bots.'],['warning','Use the deployed command list as the definitive source for currently available game modes and mechanics.']];
pages.troubleshooting.blocks=[['h2','A command does not appear'],['p','Check that the command is registered and deployed, and that your account has permission to use it. Adding a command file does not necessarily publish it to Discord.'],['h2','A command fails'],['p','Check the bot response for missing options or permission issues. Share the command name and relevant error log with the developer, but never share tokens or secrets.'],['h2','Music does not play'],['p','Confirm the bot can connect and speak in the voice channel, then try another supported source. Hosting and audio dependencies can also affect playback.'],['h2','A guild post is missing'],['p','Ask an authorized administrator to check guild recovery tools. A missing forum post does not necessarily mean the guild record itself is missing.']];
export function getStaticPaths(){return ['index','getting-started','guilds','economy','fishing','music','owo','commands','troubleshooting'].map(slug=>({params:{slug}}));}
const slug=Astro.params.slug;
const page=pages[slug];
---
<SiteLayout title={page.title} description={page.intro} active={slug==='commands'?'commands':'docs'}><div class="container docs-shell"><aside class="sidebar"><div class="sidebar-label">GETTING STARTED</div><a class:list={[slug==='index'?'active':'']} href="index.html">Overview</a><a class:list={[slug==='getting-started'?'active':'']} href="getting-started.html">Getting started</a><div class="sidebar-label">FEATURE GUIDES</div>{[['Guilds','guilds'],['Economy & progression','economy'],['Fishing','fishing'],['Music','music'],['Text games','owo']].map(([n,k])=><a class:list={[slug===k?'active':'']} href={k+'.html'}>{n}</a>)}<div class="sidebar-label">REFERENCE</div><a class:list={[slug==='commands'?'active':'']} href="commands.html">Commands</a><a class:list={[slug==='troubleshooting'?'active':'']} href="troubleshooting.html">Troubleshooting</a></aside><article class="doc-content"><span class="eyebrow">NIGHTGUILDBOT DOCUMENTATION</span><h1>{page.heading}</h1><p class="doc-intro">{page.intro}</p>{page.blocks.map(([type,value])=>type==='h2'?<h2>{value}</h2>:type==='p'?<p>{value}</p>:type==='warning'?<div class="doc-callout warning">{value}</div>:type==='callout'?<div class="doc-callout">{value}</div>:type==='code'?<pre><code>{value}</code></pre>:type==='list'?<ul>{value.map(([name,href])=><li><a href={href}>{name}</a></li>)}</ul>:type==='grid'?<div class="doc-grid">{value.map(([name,desc,href])=><a class="doc-link" href={href}><strong>{name} ↗</strong><span>{desc}</span></a>)}</div>:null)}</article></div></SiteLayout>